1006 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I\047m a highly versatile designer specializing in UX for high\055scale technical platforms\056\nProven ability to drive cross\055functional alignment and roadmap execution for complex\054 0\055to\0551 initiatives across consumer\054 enterprise\054 and developer platforms\056\n\nexperience\nStaff Product Designer \100 Snyk \023 Boston\054 MA \0502026 \055 Present\051\nI lead the design strategy for Snyk\047s Developer Experience team\054 focusing on how millions of developers interact with security within their native environments\056 My work centers on building both\050AI\055Native and AI\055Augmented tools that streamline collaboration between development and security teams\054 enabling large enterprises to scale innovation without compromising safety\056\n\nUX Designer \100 Google \023 Cambridge\054 MA \0502014 \055 2025\051\nFirebase \0502021\0232025\051\072 I owned design for pre\055release testing and observability tools used by over 3 million global developers\056 Within this scope\054 I transformed Firebase App Distribution into a full\055fledged testing tool via the App Testing Agent\054 Firebase\031s first agentic launch\056\nGoogle Ads \0502018\0232021\051\072 Designed solutions for high\055traffic\054 information\055dense campaign management tools for enterprise travel clients\056 Architected a supplier coverage solution for connected hotels that recaptured 5\045 of matched impressions and unlocked significant revenue streams\056\nGoogle Ink \0502015\0232018\051\072 Led design \046 research as the sole UX specialist to integrate drawing\057annotation functionality into high\055profile consumer products like Google Keep \046 Google Classroom\056\nGoogle Charts \0502014\0232015\051\072 Defined Data Visualization specifications for the Material Design system\054 impacting millions of users across products like Google Sheets and Analytics\054 establishing strict accessibility and internationalization standards\056\n\nEARLIER experience\nCo\055founder \046 Lead Designer \100 Vectra Creative \0502011\0232014\051\nAdvertising Designer \100 Allen Roche Group \0502010\0232011\051\nIn\055House Print Designer \100 Central Steel Supply \0502004\0232010\051\n\nEDUCATION\nAssociates in Graphic Design\nMiddlesex Community College \042 Bedford\054 MA \042 2006\0552009\n\nSkills \046 Tools\nDesign \046 Prototyping\nFigma \042 Sketch \042 Adobe Creative Suite \042 Design Systems \042  Data Visualization \042 Design Sprints\n\nResearch \046 Strategy\nA\057B Testing \042 Usability Studies\240\042 Customer Interviews \042 Cross\055functional Alignment \042  Product Strategy\n\nTechnical Literacy\nHTML5  \042  CSS3  \042  JavaScript \240\042  Git  \042  VS Code  \042  Claude  \042  Firebase Studio  \042  GitHub Copilot  \042  Cursor  \042  CLI)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 1007 0 R
